# C++ source style for the matching core (Phase-01.5 Task 1.5.3.1).
#
# Enforcement is DIFF-SCOPED in CI (scripts/ci/lint_cpp.sh): only LINES under
# core/ changed by a PR/push must be format-clean (clang-format-diff gate).
# The pre-existing tree predates clang-format — gating the diff adopts the
# style incrementally instead of demanding a ~45-file reformat in the wiring
# commit. `FORMAT_ALL=1 scripts/ci/lint_cpp.sh` audits the whole tree.
BasedOnStyle: Google
